    "Cantrips are represented as level 0.",
    "Duplicate Sacred Flame entries were merged into one spell with multiple categories.",
    "The later Sacred Flame entry was treated as canonical: radiant damage with a DEX save.",
    "Missing casting times, durations, concentration requirements, components, schools, saves, and damage formulas were not inferred.",
